3. Having been aggrieved by the judgment and award dated 16.08.2023, passed by the learned L.A. Judge, Court No. 1, West Tripura, Agartala, in Case No. MISC (L.A.)
38 of 2016, the appellant preferred this instant appeal before this Court seeking the following reliefs:-
"(a) Admit this appeal condoning the delay of 619 days.
(b) Call for the records pertaining to CASE NO. MISC. (LA) 38 of 2016, from the Ld.
Court of Land Acquisition Judge (Court No.
1), West Tripura Judicial District, Agartala;
(c) Pass an order for preparation of paper book;
(d) In the interim be kind enough to stay the impugned Judgment and award dated 16.08.2023, Case No. CIVIL MISC (L.A.) 38 of 2016, pending disposal of the appeal;
(e) After hearing the parties, be kind enough to set aside the Judgment dated 16.08.2023, Case No. MISC (L.A.) 38 of 2016, for the fair ends of justice.
4.

